WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.721 --> 00:00:14.969
Brad: Be careful, be careful!

2
00:00:14.989 --> 00:00:16.730
Danny: What's the matter?

3
00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:19.252
Brad: You might be stepping on someone!

4
00:00:19.272 --> 00:00:21.854
Danny: What's that?

5
00:00:21.874 --> 00:00:24.896
Brad: It used to be the shrink-gun.

6
00:00:24.916 --> 00:00:26.737
Danny: Uh-oh.

7
00:00:26.757 --> 00:00:30.240
Brad: Yeah, it looks like it's broken.

8
00:00:32.364 --> 00:00:33.164
Danny: Can you fix it?

9
00:00:33.204 --> 00:00:35.045
Brad: I don't know.

10
00:00:35.325 --> 00:00:36.106
It will be tough.

11
00:00:36.126 --> 00:00:37.646
Danny: Oh, well.

12
00:00:38.006 --> 00:00:39.147
I guess we should give up.

13
00:00:39.167 --> 00:00:40.888
Brad: No.

14
00:00:41.008 --> 00:00:42.769
Let's see what we can find to fix it.

15
00:00:42.789 --> 00:00:45.390
Danny: Fine.

16
00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:48.231
Brad: Here's some old gum.

17
00:00:48.251 --> 00:00:49.391
Danny: Gross!

18
00:00:49.411 --> 00:00:52.213
Brad: It will help hold the pieces together.

19
00:00:52.233 --> 00:00:55.654
Danny: How about this rubber band?

20
00:00:55.674 --> 00:00:57.335
Brad: That will be good.

21
00:00:58.175 --> 00:00:59.436
We need something more.

22
00:01:00.852 --> 00:01:03.394
Danny: I found some string and a popsicle stick.

23
00:01:03.995 --> 00:01:04.715
Will that help?

24
00:01:04.735 --> 00:01:06.397
Brad: Sure.

25
00:01:06.597 --> 00:01:07.598
It's worth a try.

26
00:01:07.618 --> 00:01:17.146
Ta-da! Danny: I don't think it's going to work.

27
00:01:17.707 --> 00:01:18.888
Brad: Don't say that.

28
00:01:19.628 --> 00:01:20.809
I haven't tried it yet.

29
00:01:20.829 --> 00:01:22.491
Danny: Okay.

30
00:01:22.871 --> 00:01:23.632
Give it a try.

31
00:01:23.652 --> 00:01:27.755
Brad: I think the bullies were standing here.

32
00:01:30.912 --> 00:01:32.053
Danny: Nothing is happening.

33
00:01:32.073 --> 00:01:33.893
Brad: I see that.

34
00:01:33.913 --> 00:01:36.375
Danny: Brad, we're both wet.

35
00:01:37.055 --> 00:01:38.676
We don't have any more nano-putty.

36
00:01:38.696 --> 00:01:41.337
Danny: There's nothing more we can do!

37
00:01:41.357 --> 00:01:48.760
Brad: Maybe, if I had a paper clip or something metallic Danny: Don't you ever give up?

38
00:01:49.961 --> 00:01:52.362
Brad: I see a gum wrapper.

39
00:01:54.122 --> 00:01:54.763
This could work.

40
00:01:54.803 --> 00:01:57.284
Danny: Let's go home!

41
00:02:01.516 --> 00:02:02.516
Brad: We can't go.

42
00:02:02.536 --> 00:02:06.457
Brad: You agreed we would restore Chuck and Dave to normal size.

43
00:02:06.477 --> 00:02:08.098
Danny: I guess so.

44
00:02:08.118 --> 00:02:09.298
Brad: Good.

45
00:02:09.638 --> 00:02:11.899
Now, I just have to add this silver wrapper.

46
00:02:11.919 --> 00:02:17.560
Danny: Use your imagination.

47
00:02:18.281 --> 00:02:19.601
That's what works for me.

48
00:02:19.621 --> 00:02:21.201
Brad: Good idea.

49
00:02:22.762 --> 00:02:25.182
Big, big, big.

50
00:02:25.202 --> 00:02:30.624
Danny: I guess your imagination isn't very good.

51
00:02:32.308 --> 00:02:33.909
Brad: It appears that it isn't.

52
00:02:33.929 --> 00:02:37.811
Danny: Now do you agree that there's nothing we can do?

53
00:02:37.831 --> 00:02:39.492
Brad: No.

54
00:02:39.612 --> 00:02:41.793
You just told me what will make it work.

55
00:02:42.774 --> 00:02:44.335
Danny: What?

56
00:02:44.355 --> 00:02:45.455
Brad: Your imagination!
